<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#EFF6FC">
<title>JIMIN ARCHIVE | 朴智旻个人收藏馆</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #EFF6FC;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --blue: #B9D8F0;
  --yellow: #F7E7A8;
  --text: #40566B;
  --muted: #8799A8;
  --line: #DCE7F0;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
    "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.page {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 900px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px 24px 40px;
}

.topbar {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding-bottom: 18px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.hero {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 85px 10px 65px;
}

.star {
  display: inline-block;
  color: #B69A48;
  background: var(--yellow);
  border-radius: 50%;
  width: 42px;
  height: 42px;
  line-height: 42px;
  font-size: 21px;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.eyebrow {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 76px);
  font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  line-height: 1.08;
}

.subtitle {
  margin-top: 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
}

.description {
  margin: 25px auto 0;
  max-width: 420px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 2.2;
}

.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.section-title h2 {
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-size: 25px;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 0 0 9px;
}

.section-title p {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--muted);
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  margin: 0;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 22px;
}

.card {
  background: var(--white);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 30px 25px 27px;
  min-height: 245px;
  transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(80, 110, 135, .08);
}

.card-icon {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--blue);
  font-size: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 26px;
}

.card:nth-child(2) .card-icon {
  background: var(--yellow);
}

.card-number {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.card h3 {
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 25px;
  margin: 10px 0;
}

.card-cn {
  font-size: 13px;
  margin-bottom: 13px;
}

.card-desc {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.9;
  min-height: 44px;
}

.card-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 18px;
  padding-bottom: 5px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--blue);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.card:nth-child(2) .card-link {
  border-color: #E5D28C;
}

.quote {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 65px 10px 45px;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 2;
}

.quote span {
  display: block;
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.footer {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding-top: 22px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  line-height: 2;
}

@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .page {
    padding: 22px 17px 30px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding: 65px 5px 48px;
  }

  .cards {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  .card {
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 25px 22px;
  }

  .card-desc {
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .quote {
    padding: 48px 5px 35px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<main class="page">

  <header class="topbar">
    <span>JIMIN ARCHIVE</span>
    <span>PERSONAL COLLECTION</span>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="star">✦</div>

    <div class="eyebrow">PARK JIMIN · 朴智旻</div>

    <h1>JIMIN<br>ARCHIVE</h1>

    <div class="subtitle">朴智旻个人收藏馆</div>

    <p class="description">
      把想要记住的瞬间，留在声音与影像里。<br>
      关于智旻的一切，慢慢收藏，慢慢回看。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Explore the Archive</h2>
      <p>选择你想进入的收藏空间</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">

      <a class="card" href="./library.html">
        <div class="card-icon">♫</div>
        <div class="card-number">01 / AUDIO</div>
        <h3>Audio Archive</h3>
        <div class="card-cn">声音收藏馆</div>
        <div class="card-desc">
          收藏声音、语音与那些值得反复聆听的瞬间。
        </div>
        <div class="card-link">进入声音收藏馆 ↗</div>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="./videos.html">
        <div class="card-icon">▶</div>
        <div class="card-number">02 / VIDEO</div>
        <h3>Video Archive</h3>
        <div class="card-cn">视频收藏馆</div>
        <div class="card-desc">
          收藏舞台、采访、幕后与镜头里的珍贵时刻。
        </div>
        <div class="card-link">进入视频收藏馆 ↗</div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="quote">
    Every moment is worth remembering.
    <span>FOR JIMIN, WITH LOVE.</span>
  </section>

  <footer class="footer">
    JIMIN ARCHIVE · EST. 2026<br>
    A PERSONAL COLLECTION MADE WITH LOVE
  </footer>

</main>
</body>
</html>
